  <h2>Why IT audit</h2>
  <p>
    Through the ISACA Greater Houston Chapter's IT Audit and AI Fundamentals
    workforce training, I learned that auditing is more than finding
    non-compliance. A complete audit follows up to confirm that
    recommendations were addressed, corrective actions were completed, or the
    risk was formally accepted. That emphasis on accountability and continuity
    is what I want to build my career on.
  </p>

  <h2>What I bring</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Framework fluency:</strong> comfort with dense policy and governance documentation.</li>
